<view class="login"><text class="eyebrow">XJTLU / CAMPUS DAY</text><view class="title">学校账号登录</view><view class="help">通过学校动态码验证身份，连接课程与考勤记录。</view><view class="form"><label>学校账号</label><input value="{{username}}" data-key="username" bindinput="input" placeholder="填写学校账号" disabled="{{busy}}"/><label>图片验证码</label><view class="captcha-row"><image wx:if="{{captcha}}" src="{{captcha}}" mode="aspectFit"/><button bindtap="refreshCaptcha" disabled="{{busy}}">{{captcha?'换一张':'获取图片验证码'}}</button></view><input value="{{imageCode}}" data-key="imageCode" bindinput="input" placeholder="输入图片中的字符" disabled="{{busy}}"/><label>动态码（OTP）</label><input value="{{otp}}" data-key="otp" bindinput="input" type="number" password placeholder="填写认证器当前动态码" disabled="{{busy}}"/></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><button class="submit" bindtap="submit" disabled="{{busy}}">{{busy?(stage||'正在读取…'):'登录并连接考勤'}}</button><view class="help">仅在当前运行会话保留学校凭证，退出后清除。小程序被微信回收后可能需要重新登录。不保存账号或验证码。</view></view>